  m_Name: LogRollGame
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MinigameDefinition
  <Id>k__BackingField: log_roll
  <SceneBuildIndex>k__BackingField: 17
  <GameType>k__BackingField: 2
  <GameDuration>k__BackingField: 90
  <IsTimeLimited>k__BackingField: 1
  <StartDelay>k__BackingField: 3
  <DisplayName>k__BackingField: Log Roll
  <Description>k__BackingField: Giant logs spin under your feet. Walk against the
    spin and jump the ridges!
  <PreviewImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7ff9fbc3323c4aa42885813e79d06ae8, type: 3}
  <Rules>k__BackingField:
  - Keep walking against the spin
  - Jump when a ridge rolls over the top
  - The spin flips direction now and then
  <Objective>k__BackingField: Stay on the log the longest.
  <Danger>k__BackingField: The spin carries you to the edge; ridges knock you off
    unless you jump.
  <Scoring>k__BackingField: Last one standing wins; survivors tie at the bell.
  <Controls>k__BackingField:
  - SPACE|Jump the ridges
  - LMB|Shove
